XFAIL: *

A script's abort() stops the build with an error, instead of hanging or
running the command.
Known failures: #122 (the abort action throws and hangs the session).

RUN: not %e2e timeout 90 -- %catter %S/Inputs/abort.js -- %e2e probe drop 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

CHECK-NOT: TIMEOUT
CHECK-NOT: PASS drop
